text:
The Solar Vendors Meet under PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana focused on expanding rooftop solar adoption and strengthening the ecosystem for clean and renewable energy in Delhi.

Under the leadership of Hon’ble Chief Minister Smt. @gupta_rekha Ji, we are working towards a cleaner, greener and more energy-efficient Delhi. 

@NitinNabin 
@blsanthosh

☀️ Solar Installation Inspection
AEE &amp; JEE, Kishanganj inspected the 3 kW rooftop solar installation at Halim Chowk, Kishanganj, to review the installation work and ensure compliance with required standards under PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana.
@SEVA_NBPDCL @ESCKISHANGANJ https://t.co/qBxrdNQVkN

Turn your rooftop into a source of clean energy with PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana, offering eligible households up to ₹78,000 in central subsidy, along with applicable Delhi incentives.

Under the leadership of Hon’ble PM Shri @narendramodi Ji and Hon’ble CM Smt. @gupta_rekha Ji, Delhi is moving towards a cleaner, more energy-efficient future.
Let the sun power your home!

@NitinNabin 
@blsanthosh

Delhi is moving towards a cleaner, greener and more sustainable future.

Under Delhi’s new Solar Energy Policy, our government is building an integrated clean energy framework that promotes renewable energy and makes the benefits of the PM Surya Ghar Yojana accessible to more households and institutions.

From expanding rooftop solar to encouraging wider adoption of clean energy, we are powering Delhi’s journey towards a sustainable and energy-efficient future.

@NitinNabin 
@blsanthosh 
@gupta_rekha
